    <!-- length of the letter itself in every direction (so a 'W'     -->
    <!-- ends up sitting on a dark blob 3× the W's width and height). -->
    <!--                                                              -->
    <!-- Mike's worry — that overlapping halos would cover            -->
    <!-- neighboring letters — is actually impossible with this       -->
    <!-- filter approach: SVG renders the dark halo blob from         -->
    <!-- SourceAlpha first, then puts the original SourceGraphic on   -->
