    <!-- middle layer (yes, they overlap each other, which actually   -->
    <!-- HELPS obscure the photo between letters), and then every     -->
    <!-- crisp glyph renders in the front layer on top of all halos   -->
    <!-- — including its neighbors' halos. Letters are never covered. -->
    <!--                                                              -->
    <!-- Implementation:                                              -->
    <!--   - TWO filters (one per line) so each is sized to its       -->
    <!--     line's font-size. Halo radius = font-size in SVG units.  -->
    <!--   - Filter region expanded to 400% so the bigger halo isn't  -->
    <!--     clipped at the SVG element's bounding box edge.          -->
    <!--   - viewBox vertical extent expanded to fit the bigger halo  -->
    <!--     above and below the arched lines.                        -->
    <!--   - HTML text below uses heavier text-shadow chains, blur    -->
    <!--     radii now ≈ each line's own font size (letter-height).   -->
