                 line 2 font-size 47 SVG units → halo radius ≈ 47 SVG units
                   filter: dilate radius 20 + blur stddev 14
                   (visible halo extent ≈ 20 + 28 = 48 ✓)

               Filter region 400% (vs 200% in G) so the bigger halo
